<title>USA: Delphos to repurchase up to 5 pct of shrs.</title>
<headline>Delphos to repurchase up to 5 pct of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DELPHOS, Ohio 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delphos Citizens Bancorp Inc, the holding company for Citizens Bank of Delphos, said Thursday that it authorized the repurchase of up to five percent of the company's 2,038,719 outstanding shares during the next six months.</p>
<p>The repurchase will be made in open market transactions, subject to the availability of stock, the company said.</p>
</text>
